<title>THAILAND: Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</title>
<headline>Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were loading or announced  at Bangkok port, the Thai tapioca association said.</p>
<p> Departure	    Charter	 Date	  Tonnes</p>
<p> WORLD SWAN	     (IAT)	 14/07/97     43,000</p>
<p> DAI JIANG		(ACT)	 15/07/97	4,000</p>
<p> BLUE L		   (STC)	 15/07/97     33,000</p>
